      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a data extraction assistant.\n\nYou will receive the final AI news digest.\n\nConvert the 5 selected news stories into clean structured JSON.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nDo not include:\n- markdown\n- ```json\n- explanations\n- introductory text\n- concluding text\n\nReturn exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"articles\": [\n    {\n      \"article_id\": \"\",\n      \"title\": \"\",\n      \"category\": \"\",\n      \"source\": \"\",\n      \"url\": \"\",\n      \"importance_score\": 0,\n      \"published_at\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nRules:\n\n- Return exactly 5 articles.\n- Preserve the original title.\n- Preserve the original URL.\n- Do not invent URLs.\n- importance_score must be a number from 0 to 10.\n- If article_id is unavailable, leave it as an empty string.\n- If published_at is unavailable, leave it as an empty string.\n\nHere is the news digest:\n\n{{ $json.text }}",
